          lede="Five stylesheets, an optional sixth for your fonts, one PostCSS plugin, and a set of rules short enough to memorize. You can convert one component this afternoon and keep the rest of your codebase exactly as it is."
        />

        <div class="l_cluster" data-gap="3" data-justify="center">
          <ActionButton href="/install/">Install BEAM</ActionButton>
          <ActionButton href="/spec/" tone="outline">Read the specification</ActionButton>
          <ActionButton href={SITE.repo} tone="outline" external>Source</ActionButton>
        </div>

        <p class="closing_section-note">
          Then open the inspector on this page. Every class you find is a Block, an Element, an
